    "ui_5957a657": "Center",
    "ui_596287b5": "Sync folder: modu. Records merge by stable identity, reading positions use the latest operation, and reading sessions are deduplicated. Fonts stay local. Reliable ETag mode: isolated probes verify conditional writes; database8.db is the primary archive, and covered logs are removed only after a conditional update and read-back verification. Compatibility mode: immutable record-log-v1 batches are compacted at 64 batches; covered inputs are removed only after uploading and verifying their replacement, without overwriting the shared database. Both modes retain tombstones and leave books, covers and legacy database7.db untouched. Back up and update all devices before syncing. Legacy daily totals use the larger value per book/day.",
