    "ui_6bbe7f8e": "Download and use",
    "ui_6c2df05d": "Use a calm, steady tone.",
    "ui_6c78bff": "Used to check whether the model service can respond normally",
    "ui_6cafda82": "Use a clear, bright voice with a light, natural tone. Be lively without exaggeration, leaving natural pauses between sentences.",
    "ui_6cd452e6": "This book is already available on your bookshelf.",
    "ui_6d1b13dd": "Import / manage dictionaries",
    "ui_6d9059ba": "Export all",
    "ui_6da845b6": "Includes rules between text columns. Chapter on the right; remaining pages and book position on the left.",
    "ui_6e138ea9": "Selection search opens inside Modu. Choose a default or switch in the search window. The selected website receives your query; availability depends on your network.",
    "ui_6e199c95": "Open-source projects and credits",
    "ui_6e60f8d4": "Drag to reorder",
    "ui_6e730618": "All platforms retain a small local journal of sanitized errors and checkpoints, never attached or uploaded by default. Opting in includes available crash diagnostics, not ordinary logs, AI settings, keys or book text. Review before sharing: reports become public. Reports with logs are copied for you to paste into GitHub.",
    "ui_6e733d2b": "Folder",
