    "ui_745de1f5": "Repeat password (at least 12 characters)",
    "ui_7593b3b5": "Use a low elderly male voice with a hint of age but clear articulation. Speak in an unhurried, friendly tone, pausing according to meaning, suitable for memoirs.",
