    "ui_cae34bfa": "Delete the {count} selected books? Their files and local vector indexes will also be deleted.",
    "ui_cbda3c4f": "Model parameters",
    "ui_cc6f8540": "Checking and downloading use the same source, with GitHub preferred by default. If a check cannot reach GitHub, both switch to Gitee. Check again after changing sources before downloading. Your browser handles the download; Modu cannot monitor its progress or verify the downloaded file. No books, notes or account keys are sent.",
    "ui_cd93c8b7": "Up to date (or newer than the published release)",
