    "ui_fc514e70": "Restore backup",
    "ui_fc740faa": "Results depend on the provider and model; prompts do not replace Voice or clone a voice. Set the player rate and pitch to 1.0 when controlling them with text to avoid conflicts. Use Save settings to apply.",
