    "ui_fe446080": "Select translation engine",
    "ui_fe632310": "AI selection templates are managed here separately, disabled by default and use your current AI provider. Each question starts a new conversation in the reader AI popup, returning to the answer start on completion. Search, translation, dictionary and speech share their feature settings. Toolbar configuration is included in global settings backups.",
